<title>USA: Calif. $54 mln housing bonds yld 6.20 pct in 2022.</title>
<headline>Calif. $54 mln housing bonds yld 6.20 pct in 2022.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
